# Copy to web/.env (gitignored) to prefill the test pages. Dev server only: `vite build` takes index.html
# as its only input, so nothing under test/ — and no VITE_ value one of them reads — reaches a bundle.
#
# The scout install as den-remux takes it: an origin in its SCOUT_ORIGINS and exactly ONE base64url config
# segment. The library holds the same URL with /manifest.json on the end; the bench strips that for you, but
# a second path segment of any other kind is refused as `bad_scout` before a request is made.
#
# VITE_REMUX_SCOUT=https://d-scout.oxy.fi/<config>

# Optional, and only needed to exercise subtitle renditions.
# VITE_REMUX_SUBTITLES=https://d-subs.oxy.fi/<config>
